  "groundingSupports": [
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 86,
        "endIndex": 413,
        "text": "#### **Candidate [1]: Nvidia Reportedly Agrees to Acquire Hugging Face for $13 Billion**\n* **Confirmed:** Reporting by *The Information*, *Business Insider*, *Forbes*, and *Reuters* confirms that Nvidia and Hugging Face have held acquisition discussions valuing the open-weight AI model platform at approximately $12.9B to $13B"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0,
        1,
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 415,
        "endIndex": 542,
        "text": "* **Caveats:** Neither Nvidia nor Hugging Face has publicly issued an official corporate press release confirming a signed deal"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        1,
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 544,
        "endIndex": 657,
        "text": "Reports indicate that while terms have been agreed upon, final signatures and regulatory clearance remain pending"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        1,
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 798,
        "endIndex": 1036,
        "text": "#### **Candidate [2]: Pollen Robotics / Hugging Face Announces Microduck Biped Robot**\n* **Confirmed:** Pollen Robotics (acquired by Hugging Face) announced \"Microduck,\" an open-source, 25 cm tall bipedal desktop robot weighing under 800g"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        4,
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1038,
        "endIndex": 1158,
        "text": "It features 15 motors, built-in camera, LiDAR/depth sensors, and an open software stack, with pre-orders opening at $399"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        4,
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1160,
        "endIndex": 1244,
        "text": "* **Caveats:** Deliveries are targeted for later in the year (before Christmas 2026)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1316,
        "endIndex": 1743,
        "text": "#### **Candidate [4]: OpenAI, Anthropic, AWS, Microsoft & 100+ Companies Issue AI Cyberattack Warning**\n* **Confirmed:** Reported by *Axios* (Sam Sabin), a coalition of over 100 technology and cybersecurity companies—including OpenAI, Anthropic, AWS, and Microsoft—published an open letter warning that organizations have a narrow window (months) to defend critical infrastructure against automated, AI-enabled cyberattacks"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        8,
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1745,
        "endIndex": 1898,
        "text": "* **Caveats:** The letter serves as an industry policy warning and call for collective action rather than a specific technical security breach disclosure"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1969,
        "endIndex": 2231,
        "text": "#### **Candidate [7]: OpenAI Testing \"Persistent Mode\" in Codex Agents**\n* **Confirmed:** Code analysis reviewed by *Wired* (Maxwell Zeff) and confirmed by an OpenAI spokesperson indicates OpenAI is testing a \"Persistent mode\" in its Codex command-line interface"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
